  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Streamline Your Business Processes with Salesforce Integration",
    "splashDescription": "Enhance your Camunda processes with seamless integration to Salesforce CRM. With the Salesforce Connector, you can execute SOQL queries, and manage SObjects, right from Camunda. This powerful tool makes it easy to synchronize data, automate CRM tasks, and enrich your business processes without leaving the Camunda environment.",
